{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite", "body": [{"content": "治理新兴技术背后的规范和价值观类型是否重要", "from": 0.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 7.57}, {"content": "比如人工智能、量子技术", "from": 7.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 9.77}, {"content": "有很多担忧存在", "from": 9.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 12.08}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 12.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 13.04}, {"content": "中国被指控滥用了一些这些权力", "from": 13.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 15.92}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 17.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 17.48}, {"content": "关于人脸识别软件和各种社会管控措施", "from": 17.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 22.48}, {"content": "你知道的", "from": 22.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 22.84}, {"content": "监控公众并建立系统", "from": 22.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 25.12}, {"content": "美国也被指责滥用了一些这些", "from": 25.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 29.62}, {"content": "关于", "from": 29.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 30.86}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 30.86, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 31.42}, {"content": "电子通信", "from": 31.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 32.74}, {"content": "情报等", "from": 32.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 34.19}, {"content": "但我想从个人角度了解", "from": 34.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 36.23}, {"content": "我和你作为个人", "from": 36.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 37.19}, {"content": "以及我们的观众作为普通人", "from": 37.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 38.59}, {"content": "我们应该担心AI如何部署以创造新的控制方式", "from": 38.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 45.19}, {"content": "并真正用技术剥夺任何自由主义", "from": 45.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 50.14}, {"content": "基本上就是", "from": 50.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 52.24}, {"content": "钉下棺材使其成为非自由主义", "from": 52.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 55.36}, {"content": "自由主义的未来", "from": 55.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 56.9}, {"content": "我们最可能的未来", "from": 56.9, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 59.09}, {"content": "让我敞开心扉告诉你内心的想法", "from": 59.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 66.6}, {"content": "我认为人类不应担忧中美竞争", "from": 66.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 73.36}, {"content": "真正需要担心的是AI最终是否会脱离人类", "from": 73.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 80.97}, {"content": "并最终统治人类", "from": 80.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 85.09}, {"content": "指我们所有人", "from": 85.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 86.43}, {"content": "智人", "from": 86.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 87.43}, {"content": "全人类", "from": 87.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 88.55}, {"content": "我们八十多亿人", "from": 88.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 89.59}, {"content": "当今世界全体将沦为二等公民", "from": 89.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 97.21}, {"content": "呃", "from": 97.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 97.81}, {"content": "在旧系统前", "from": 97.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 99.82}, {"content": "呃", "from": 99.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 100.46}, {"content": "主导专横", "from": 100.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 101.88}, {"content": "我认为人类应立即国际协作", "from": 101.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 109.929}, {"content": "避免这一场景", "from": 109.929, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 112.389}, {"content": "因为我不希望看到我的孩子和后代", "from": 112.389, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 117.119}, {"content": "或人类沦为二等公民", "from": 117.119, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 120.78}, {"content": "被至高无上的", "from": 120.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 123.02}, {"content": "呃", "from": 124.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 124.67}, {"content": "人工智能统治", "from": 124.67, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 126.21}, {"content": "我认为我们已站在临界点", "from": 126.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 128.95}, {"content": "我们面临十字路口", "from": 128.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 130.389}, {"content": "如果", "from": 130.389, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 130.889}, {"content": "例如中美两国", "from": 130.889, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 132.689}, {"content": "真正一次", "from": 132.689, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 133.549}, {"content": "彼此竞争", "from": 133.549, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 134.989}, {"content": "各自开发旨在摧毁对方的AI版本", "from": 134.989, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 139.48}, {"content": "例如，最终的赢家不会是美国或中国", "from": 139.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 144.15}, {"content": "最终的赢家将是人工智能本身", "from": 144.15, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 147.42}, {"content": "而这可能就是", "from": 147.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 150.32}, {"content": "如果不是人类文明的开端", "from": 150.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 154.17}, {"content": "我们需要觉醒", "from": 154.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 155.67}, {"content": "我们非常感谢您的参与", "from": 155.67, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 157.45}, {"content": "维克多·加啊", "from": 157.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 158.16}, {"content": "全球化与中美研究中心副总裁", "from": 158.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 160.54}, {"content": "非常感谢您从加拿大远道而来，与我们分享这些深刻见解", "from": 160.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 164.06}, {"content": "在此多哈论坛", "from": 164.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 165.48}, {"content": "非常感谢", "from": 165.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 166.32}, {"content": "这是莫大的荣幸", "from": 166.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 167.04}, {"content": "那么核心结论是什么", "from": 168.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 170.32}, {"content": "中国有许多值得感恩的理由", "from": 170.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 173.1}, {"content": "应该感谢美国对其未来的坚定信心", "from": 173.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 177.48}, {"content": "以及过去三十年数百亿美元的投资", "from": 177.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 181.08}, {"content": "实际上帮助中国成为今天的非凡强国", "from": 181.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 185.35}, {"content": "也应该感谢美国在中东的政策陷入泥潭", "from": 185.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 189.17}, {"content": "从战争到战争，从危机到危机", "from": 189.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 191.35}, {"content": "而中国则悄然推进和平崛起", "from": 191.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 194.13}, {"content": "但现在华盛顿将自身助力打造的成功视为威胁", "from": 194.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 198.71}, {"content": "希望减少对北京的依赖", "from": 198.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 201.43}, {"content": "建立不经过中国的供应链", "from": 201.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 203.73}, {"content": "并可能减少贸易规模重建制造业", "from": 203.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 207.93}, {"content": "在摧毁它后又试图重建中国，这似乎有些野心勃勃", "from": 207.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 212.22}, {"content": "或许这就是为什么中国并不太担忧", "from": 212.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 214.56}, {"content": "这就是核心结论", "from": 214.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 216.62}]}